  "sourceHtml": "<p>作为国内主流的AI大模型，Qwen千问凭借强大的中文理解与推理能力，以及丰富的阿里生态协同，已经赋能众多AI硬件为用户打造出色的AI功能体验。近期，千问发布了AI眼镜、AI耳机等多款硬件产品，通过深度融合千问App，把AI能力从手机屏幕延伸到各类穿戴终端。</p><p>此次将要拆解的Qwen千问AI耳夹式耳机，将开放式音频、千问AI能力和Bose声学技术相结合。外观上针对亚洲人耳型优化佩戴结构，且不分左右耳，兼顾佩戴舒适性与日常使用便利性。音频体验上，该产品搭载12磁铁双环聚磁单元，支持LHDC 5.0高清蓝牙音频解码，并经由BOSE大师调音，通过了Hi-Res AUDIO Wireless金标认证，为用户提供高品质音质。</p><p>千问AI耳夹式耳机还支持AI识别场景，智能识别音乐、影视、博客等场景，自动切换Bose音效、千问AI音效、通透人声、静谧轻听模式，提供最佳听音体验；支持3D空间音频，通过空间音频算法（HRTF）搭配头部追踪，提供如临现场的沉浸式体验；支持3麦克风+骨传导AI通话降噪，实时增强和分离人声，提供清晰通话效果。</p><p>在核心AI功能方面，千问AI耳夹式耳机深度融合千问大模型能力，支持语音调用千问AI服务，实现自然语言交互与任务处理；同时支持AI实时录音转写、离线本地录音、92种语言转写及纪要生成，以及89种语言AI翻译，覆盖面对面交流、通话等多种场景。续航方面，耳机单次续航约9小时，搭配充电盒综合续航约40小时，并支持无线充电。下面就来看看这款产品的详细拆解报告吧~</p><h4>一、Qwen千问AI耳夹式耳机开箱</h4><p><span><img src=\"https://52audio-images.oss-cn-shenzhen.aliyuncs.com/uploads/2026/11/09/dmqaxpjw82ysjmhitj\"></span></p><p>Qwen千问AI耳夹式耳机包装盒体积轻薄、设计简约，天地盖结构，顶部展示有耳机简笔图，品牌LOGO和产品名称，以及Hi-Res AUDIO Wireless和SOUND BY BOSE标志。</p><p><span><img src=\"https://52audio-images.oss-cn-shenzhen.aliyuncs.com/uploads/2026/11/09/dmqaxq942bcdae1ogl\"></span></p><p>包装盒底部介绍了产品的详细功能特点：超强劲双环聚磁单元、Bose大师联合调音、随身千问 AI 助理、AI 降噪双向清晰、全天佩戴 稳固舒适、听记翻译 一步到位。底部还贴有产品标签，产品名称：千问 AI 耳夹式耳机，型号：QW-SE01，产品颜色：极光紫，制造商：上海千问智联人工智能科技有限责任公司</p><p><span><img src=\"https://52audio-images.oss-cn-shenzhen.aliyuncs.com/uploads/2026/11/09/dmqaxqh8vcjpi8go8u\"></span></p><p>包装盒侧边设计有LHDC标志。</p><p><span><img src=\"https://52audio-images.oss-cn-shenzhen.aliyuncs.com/uploads/2026/11/09/dmqaxr5lw5qtyx5ugz\"></span></p><p>打开包装盒，取出内部所有物品，包括了主机、SN码标签和产品使用说明书。</p><p><span><img src=\"https://52audio-images.oss-cn-shenzhen.aliyuncs.com/uploads/2026/11/09/dmqaxrf88kjoubxm3o\"></span></p><p>千问AI耳夹式耳机采用圆角矩形设计，磨砂质感，体积小巧轻便。机身正面设计有Qwen品牌LOGO和一颗指示灯。</p><p><span><img src=\"https://52audio-images.oss-cn-shenzhen.aliyuncs.com/uploads/2026/11/09/dmqaxrochut0qfegzr\"></span></p><p>充电盒背面外观一览，转轴上设计有“SOUND BY BOSE”标识。背部同时也是无线充电接收区域。</p><p><span><img src=\"https://52audio-images.oss-cn-shenzhen.aliyuncs.com/uploads/2026/11/09/dmqaxrxsrngtkpyye4\"></span></p><p>充电盒底部设置Type-C充电接口。</p><p><span><img src=\"https://52audio-images.oss-cn-shenzhen.aliyuncs.com/uploads/2026/11/09/dmqaxs6gfgeuvkxfkz\"></span></p><p>充电盒右侧设置蓝牙配对功能按键。</p><p><span><img src=\"https://52audio-images.oss-cn-shenzhen.aliyuncs.com/uploads/2026/11/09/dmqaxshufinsme9xb4\"></span></p><p>打开充电盒盖，内部耳机交叉放置，磁吸固定，不分左右耳，取出即可佩戴。</p><p><span><img src=\"https://52audio-images.oss-cn-shenzhen.aliyuncs.com/uploads/2026/11/09/dmqaxt6egpd8ulwvxm\"></span></p><p>取出耳机，座舱内部结构一览，两侧设置有为耳机充电的金属弹片。</p><p><span><img src=\"https://52audio-images.oss-cn-shenzhen.aliyuncs.com/uploads/2026/11/09/dmqaxtul4c6sdchd9v\"></span></p><p>盒盖内侧标注有产品参数信息，型号：QW_SE01，输入：5V-1A，输出：5V-0.216A，电池：530mAh 3.91V 2.08Wh。</p><p><span><img src=\"https://52audio-images.oss-cn-shenzhen.aliyuncs.com/uploads/2026/11/09/dmqaxu0o7kffixwu6o\"></span></p><p>Qwen千问AI耳夹式耳机整体外观一览。</p><p><span><img src=\"https://52audio-images.oss-cn-shenzhen.aliyuncs.com/uploads/2026/11/09/dmqaxu6fbgc6htsgux\"></span></p><p>千问AI耳夹式耳机外观一览，采用NCVM真空镀膜工艺，呈现高光镜面金属质感。C桥外部采用高弹柔韧软件材质，内嵌0.5mm超薄记忆钛丝，佩戴夹持力适中，但弯曲后回弹力度较慢。</p><p><span><img src=\"https://52audio-images.oss-cn-shenzhen.aliyuncs.com/uploads/2026/11/09/dmqaxucep15uuac327\"></span></p><p>前端音腔（听音球）外观一览，C桥与腔体一体化设计，使机身线条更加流畅。</p><p><span><img src=\"https://52audio-images.oss-cn-shenzhen.aliyuncs.com/uploads/2026/11/09/dmqaxuyoi9u00c4ju4\"></span></p><p>音腔底部的出音孔特写，通过金属盖板防护，内部设置有麦克风。</p><p><span><img src=\"https://52audio-images.oss-cn-shenzhen.aliyuncs.com/uploads/2026/11/09/dmqaxvmcx94agcinkm\"></span></p><p>音腔两侧设置有调音孔，用于保障腔体内部空气流通，提升音频性能。</p><p><span><img src=\"https://52audio-images.oss-cn-shenzhen.aliyuncs.com/uploads/2026/11/09/dmqaxw8laveqfgydat\"></span></p><p>C桥上的麦克风拾音孔特写。</p><p><span><img src=\"https://52audio-images.oss-cn-shenzhen.aliyuncs.com/uploads/2026/11/09/dmqaxwde3pld2kqyh2\"></span></p><p>后端腔体（能量豆）外观一览，采用水滴流线型设计，背部为无线触控区域，长按唤醒/推出语音助手，也可以通过语音“你好千问”唤醒语音助手。</p><p><span><img src=\"https://52audio-images.oss-cn-shenzhen.aliyuncs.com/uploads/2026/11/09/dmqaxwz2agb2ymungw\"></span></p><p>腔体内侧设置有光学佩戴检测传感器，用于实现摘取自动暂停音乐播放、佩戴自动恢复播放功能。</p><p><span><img src=\"https://52audio-images.oss-cn-shenzhen.aliyuncs.com/uploads/2026/11/09/dmqaxxlbcqg28tk80s\"></span></p><p>腔体侧边的麦克风拾音孔特写。</p><p><span><img src=\"https://52audio-images.oss-cn-shenzhen.aliyuncs.com/uploads/2026/11/09/dmqaxy6v99gw9yuywz\"></span></p><p>腔体底部的充电触点特写。</p><p><span><img src=\"https://52audio-images.oss-cn-shenzhen.aliyuncs.com/uploads/2026/11/09/dmqaxyc02hvqbesrvq\"></span></p><p>经我爱音频网实测，Qwen千问AI耳夹式耳机整机重量约为46.7g，轻巧便携。</p><p><span><img src=\"https://52audio-images.oss-cn-shenzhen.aliyuncs.com/uploads/2026/11/09/dmqaxyh7iv45akutbs\"></span></p><p>单只耳机重量约为5.8g。</p><p><span><img src=\"https://52audio-images.oss-cn-shenzhen.aliyuncs.com/uploads/2026/11/09/dmqaxz2bheklshpfw0\"></span></p><p>我爱音频网采用<a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzkwMTcyNDkxMw==&amp;mid=2247487498&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=64519ff70791fd734ca2a3fa10961d42&amp;source=41&amp;poc_token=HLPC3mqjxcVizK9i0FgDKzW6NoA9QGBhqKBaPJtQ\">CHARGERLAB POWER-Z KM003C</a>测试仪对Qwen千问AI耳夹式耳机进行有线充电测试，输入功率约为3.78W。</p><h4>二、Qwen千问AI耳夹式耳机拆解</h4><p>通过开箱，我们详细了解了Qwen千问AI耳夹式耳机的轻巧外观设计，下面进入拆解部分，看看内部结构配置信息~</p><h4>充电盒拆解</h4><p><span><img src=\"https://52audio-images.oss-cn-shenzhen.aliyuncs.com/uploads/2026/11/09/dmqaxznq66dvwsjd1g\"></span></p><p>拆开外壳，取出座舱结构。</p><p><span><img src=\"https://52audio-images.oss-cn-shenzhen.aliyuncs.com/uploads/2026/11/09/dmqay09ozl0aajs82m\"></span></p><p>座舱正面结构一览，上方设置有指示灯和霍尔元件排线，下方通过支架固定主板和电池单元。</p><p><span><img src=\"https://52audio-images.oss-cn-shenzhen.aliyuncs.com/uploads/2026/11/09/dmqay0vnhdm4cc9rsp\"></span></p><p>座舱背面设置无线充电接收线圈，导线与主板焊接。</p><p><span><img src=\"https://52audio-images.oss-cn-shenzhen.aliyuncs.com/uploads/2026/11/09/dmqay1097zp8bcbsm7\"></span></p><p>断开焊点，拆掉线充电接收线圈。</p><p><span><img src=\"https://52audio-images.oss-cn-shenzhen.aliyuncs.com/uploads/2026/11/09/dmqay1ll0h1oye1fa4\"></span></p><p>支架底部主板结构一览，通过螺丝固定，与电池导线焊接，与排线通过连接器连接。</p><p><span><img src=\"https://52audio-images.oss-cn-shenzhen.aliyuncs.com/uploads/2026/11/09/dmqay27r9to4uf0pfw\"></span></p><p>腔体侧边排线连接功能按键和为耳机充电的金属弹片。</p><p><span><img src=\"https://52audio-images.oss-cn-shenzhen.aliyuncs.com/uploads/2026/11/09/dmqay2tl0qkph8pprk\"></span></p><p>卸掉螺丝，取掉座舱底部支架及所有组件。</p><p><span><img src=\"https://52audio-images.oss-cn-shenzhen.aliyuncs.com/uploads/2026/11/09/dmqay2yk9sw71pqwax\"></span></p><p>座舱底部结构一览，设置有2组四颗磁铁，用于固定耳机和充电盒盖。</p><p><span><img src=\"https://52audio-images.oss-cn-shenzhen.aliyuncs.com/uploads/2026/11/09/dmqay3k2sn1ecu1mig\"></span></p><p>支架内侧结构一览。内部设置电池单元，覆盖有海绵垫，起到很好的保护。</p><p><span><img src=\"https://52audio-images.oss-cn-shenzhen.aliyuncs.com/uploads/2026/11/09/dmqay3pc390bt87sch\"></span></p><p>挑开连接器，取掉排线。</p><p><span><img src=\"https://52audio-images.oss-cn-shenzhen.aliyuncs.com/uploads/2026/11/09/dmqay3u7w2rlmr298d\"></span></p><p>取出腔体内部的电池。</p><p><span><img src=\"https://52audio-images.oss-cn-shenzhen.aliyuncs.com/uploads/2026/11/09/dmqay5ed4uhuwnq6dg\"></span></p><p>充电盒内部排线一侧电路一览，两侧设置为耳机充电的金属弹片；顶部排线上设置霍尔元件，用于开盖即连。</p><p><span><img src=\"https://52audio-images.oss-cn-shenzhen.aliyuncs.com/uploads/2026/11/09/dmqay7ekiw42lvidcc\"></span></p><p>充电盒内部排线另外一侧电路一览，左侧设置微动按键，下方有指示灯。</p><p><span><img src=\"https://52audio-images.oss-cn-shenzhen.aliyuncs.com/uploads/2026/11/09/dmqay80a0yyjcrelt4\"></span></p><p>充电盒内置锂电池标签信息一览，可充电聚合物锂离子电池组，型号：AEC701833，额定容量：530mAh，额定能量：2.08Wh，标称电压：3.91V，充电限制电压：4.50V，生产厂：广东国光电子有限公司。</p><p><span><img src=\"https://52audio-images.oss-cn-shenzhen.aliyuncs.com/uploads/2026/11/09/dmqay8lyp6ibndpazu\"></span></p><p>电芯上丝印信息一览，与标签上一致。</p><p><span><img src=\"https://52audio-images.oss-cn-shenzhen.aliyuncs.com/uploads/2026/11/09/dmqay97l4o0xit57se\"></span></p><p>撕开外部绝缘保护，电池保护板正面电路一览。</p><p><span><img src=\"https://52audio-images.oss-cn-shenzhen.aliyuncs.com/uploads/2026/11/09/dmqay9te6jo7ipw9a4\"></span></p><p>电池保护板背面电路一览。</p><p><span><img src=\"https://52audio-images.oss-cn-shenzhen.aliyuncs.com/uploads/2026/11/09/dmqayaejvbr8xyh12n\"></span></p><p>丝印5o AG的锂电保护IC，负责电池的过充电、过放电、过电流和短路等保护。</p><p><span><img src=\"https://52audio-images.oss-cn-shenzhen.aliyuncs.com/uploads/2026/11/09/dmqayb0bvvuz74r3ja\"></span></p><p>充电盒主板一侧电路一览。</p><p><span><img src=\"https://52audio-images.oss-cn-shenzhen.aliyuncs.com/uploads/2026/11/09/dmqaybm3nvzkzwee5o\"></span></p><p>充电盒主板另外侧一侧电路一览。</p><p><span><img src=\"https://52audio-images.oss-cn-shenzhen.aliyuncs.com/uploads/2026/11/09/dmqayc7ii41x0hgyn3\"></span></p><p>思远半导体SY6302是一款适用于单节锂电池的超低功耗电量计芯片。SY6302使用16位ADC，可实现电池电压、电流和温度的高精度测量。电流采样电阻支持高边和低边两种配置，电池温度测量可选择芯片内部温度或者外部热敏电阻。通过实时监测电池的工作状态结合专有的电量计算法，可实现电池百分比电量（SOC）和电池健康状态（SOH）等信息上报。</p><p>SY6302内置32位处理器和flash，主机可通过I2C接口在线更新固件和电量计配置参数，支持厂商对ADC进行二次校准以及电池历史运行数据记录。该器件内置64位唯一ID，支持电池防伪认证算法。</p><p><span><img src=\"https://52audio-images.oss-cn-shenzhen.aliyuncs.com/uploads/2026/11/09/dmqayctne8ecc9fgcm\"></span></p><p>思远半导体SY6302详细资料图。据我爱音频网拆解了解到，思远半导体的电源管理类芯片已被<a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/29YKpNZc9YP11Ra2QhmPjA?token=643893572&amp;lang=zh_CN\">小米、vivo、OPPO、realme、韶音、Keep、悠律声学、Nothing、夸克、出门问问，</a><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/ZLpyknQeR6RRaIC43zN7bg?token=302516844&amp;lang=zh_CN\">REDMI、漫步者、倍思、绿联、万魔、猛玛、博雅、神牛、闪克、优篮子、眷蜀、西圣、飞利浦</a>，<a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/YrTMzcfnIywEK1SmIFT80w?token=1654983795&amp;lang=zh_CN\">三星、一加、字节跳动、JBL、小天才、Cleer、捷波朗、斯莫格、NuPhy、高驰、翡声、枫笛、海尔兄弟、泥炭、左点、TG</a>、<a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzU5NzE0NjE0MQ==&amp;mid=2247764017&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=095c7fdfa077d5fe1e705bfac549e8f9&amp;chksm=fe596743c92eee5508ba5e0990fdb30004ce0ef0ad3dfff0855c33d047f15d2adf8b05ab73c4&amp;token=1784166172&amp;lang=zh_CN#rd\">iQOO、联想、传音、科大讯飞、用维、公牛、Fiio、翡声、MEES、YOBYBO、HAYLOU、DENON、Oladance、XTOUR、final、酷睿视、Skullcandy</a>、<a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzU5NzE0NjE0MQ==&amp;mid=2247690880&amp;idx=3&amp;sn=0243ef542f4ea2e08a7c49dbd7523821&amp;chksm=fe5a45f2c92dcce4609a46933a1d0d34a98af00c94cd71384915e1a2b514b46c97c5696043ea#rd\">QCY</a>、<a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzU5NzE0NjE0MQ==&amp;mid=2247693174&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=accd24083f1e454663c7d8bb0b0764a5&amp;chksm=fe5a5c04c92dd512b0b5d45381b32f71629d34c593803282934e82b56c6e01e526bfa6d9b78c&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\">声阔</a><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzU5NzE0NjE0MQ==&amp;mid=2247605735&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=656bf3f4be7252c4993a25daba47c9c8&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\">、魅族、百度、网易、哈曼</a><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzU5NzE0NjE0MQ==&amp;mid=2247518360&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=a5170037f1d24ea967dfed844184a32e&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\">、233621、魔宴、创新科技</a>等众多国内外知名品牌旗下产品采用。</p><p><span><img src=\"https://52audio-images.oss-cn-shenzhen.aliyuncs.com/uploads/2026/11/09/dmqaydfavxkslxlkb8\"></span></p><p>丝印DRAGON02LP G1901的无线充电接收芯片。</p><p><span><img src=\"https://52audio-images.oss-cn-shenzhen.aliyuncs.com/uploads/2026/11/09/dmqaye0wa7kxovs9hf\"></span></p><p>SinhMicro昇生微电子SSP707电源管理芯片，集成了38V耐压OVP、开关Charger、Boost等功能，用于为内置电池充电，以及升压为耳机充电。</p><p><span><img src=\"https://52audio-images.oss-cn-shenzhen.aliyuncs.com/uploads/2026/11/09/dmqayeme1izjc10fie\"></span></p><p>丝印8428的IC。</p><p><span><img src=\"https://52audio-images.oss-cn-shenzhen.aliyuncs.com/uploads/2026/11/09/dmqayf7re2wrszzrie\"></span></p><p>丝印24AP的TVS保护管。</p><p><span><img src=\"https://52audio-images.oss-cn-shenzhen.aliyuncs.com/uploads/2026/11/09/dmqayftbqto5xac8y7\"></span></p><p>SouthChip南芯SS26L113NRSA RISC-V低功耗微控制器，用于充电盒整机控制。</p><p><span><img src=\"https://52audio-images.oss-cn-shenzhen.aliyuncs.com/uploads/2026/11/09/dmqaygetgniyer8lv4\"></span></p><p>连接排线的ZIF连接器特写，来自亚奇科技（OCN），型号：OK-F501-12325。</p><h4>耳机拆解</h4><p><span><img src=\"https://52audio-images.oss-cn-shenzhen.aliyuncs.com/uploads/2026/11/09/dmqaygipxnc1gmdgbo\"></span></p><p>拆解耳机部分，取掉能量豆内侧盖板。盖板内侧设置有佩戴检测传感器排线；腔体内部设置主板单元，与排线通过BTB连接器连接。</p><p><span><img src=\"https://52audio-images.oss-cn-shenzhen.aliyuncs.com/uploads/2026/11/09/dmqaygnrjq5qug7fvh\"></span></p><p>取出腔体内部主板。</p><p><span><img src=\"https://52audio-images.oss-cn-shenzhen.aliyuncs.com/uploads/2026/11/09/dmqayh9i0c5ow5zkzt\"></span></p><p>耳机主板一侧电路一览。</p><p><span><img src=\"https://52audio-images.oss-cn-shenzhen.aliyuncs.com/uploads/2026/11/09/dmqayhvywh4a92vthv\"></span></p><p>耳机主板另外一侧电路一览。</p><p><span><img src=\"https://52audio-images.oss-cn-shenzhen.aliyuncs.com/uploads/2026/11/09/dmqayiiuz7bswocraj\"></span></p><p>丝印AN T5J的IC，推测为六轴传感器，用于空间音频和敲击控制等功能。</p><p><span><img src=\"https://52audio-images.oss-cn-shenzhen.aliyuncs.com/uploads/2026/11/09/dmqayj4a4mmbvh5xqu\"></span></p><p>丝印6HY的IC。</p><p><span><img src=\"https://52audio-images.oss-cn-shenzhen.aliyuncs.com/uploads/2026/11/09/dmqayjpz07mxwa46jq\"></span></p><p>丝印79HLW的IC，推测为存储器，用于存储固件和离线录音文件。</p><p><span><img src=\"https://52audio-images.oss-cn-shenzhen.aliyuncs.com/uploads/2026/11/09/dmqaykc12en5m1gulw\"></span></p><p>思远半导体SY6302电量计芯片。</p><p><span><img src=\"https://52audio-images.oss-cn-shenzhen.aliyuncs.com/uploads/2026/11/09/dmqayky3fg1mvrj9uh\"></span></p><p>连接耳机内部排线的BTB连接器母座。</p><p><span><img src=\"https://52audio-images.oss-cn-shenzhen.aliyuncs.com/uploads/2026/11/09/dmqaylkbdf7fbhnciu\"></span></p><p>丝印284E AUUS的IC。</p><p><span><img src=\"https://52audio-images.oss-cn-shenzhen.aliyuncs.com/uploads/2026/11/09/dmqaym5p6k78rmmawc\"></span></p><p>BES恒玄科技BES2810ZP蓝牙音频SoC，支持蓝牙6.1，用于无线连接和音频数据处理。</p><p><span><img src=\"https://52audio-images.oss-cn-shenzhen.aliyuncs.com/uploads/2026/11/09/dmqaymr9ht36zhyecm\"></span></p><p>24.0MHz的晶振特写，为蓝牙芯片提供时钟。</p><p><span><img src=\"https://52audio-images.oss-cn-shenzhen.aliyuncs.com/uploads/2026/11/09/dmqaynenp1hlhgdvrp\"></span></p><p>丝印B9A WJA的IC。</p><p><span><img src=\"https://52audio-images.oss-cn-shenzhen.aliyuncs.com/uploads/2026/11/09/dmqaynjlsothuoqjuj\"></span></p><p>拆掉盖板内侧排线。</p><p><span><img src=\"https://52audio-images.oss-cn-shenzhen.aliyuncs.com/uploads/2026/11/09/dmqaynpkh4shpxlj8m\"></span></p><p>取出腔体内部的电池及排线。</p><p><span><img src=\"https://52audio-images.oss-cn-shenzhen.aliyuncs.com/uploads/2026/11/09/dmqaynuunfibbkmkuv\"></span></p><p>能量豆内部排线电路一览。</p><p><span><img src=\"https://52audio-images.oss-cn-shenzhen.aliyuncs.com/uploads/2026/11/09/dmqayoiefsw7pphf4g\"></span></p><p>耳机内置软包扣式电池特写，由于产品封装工艺扎实、布局紧凑，拆解取出过程中有点变形。电池型号：HPT 1240，额定容量：55mAh 0.212Wh，来自HPT豪鹏科技。</p><p>据我爱音频网拆解了解到，目前已有<a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/5GLHEYmicYz--RWNx5hK6g\">理想</a>、<a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzU5NzE0NjE0MQ==&amp;mid=2247780544&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=d7ccda9416d71548f350a6e84a38c461&amp;chksm=fe5927b2c92eaea4b1f2fde1be87015c5215506d019660c2e01e1d267728f4c88c083080fc59&amp;token=928532160&amp;lang=zh_CN#rd\">大疆</a>、<a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzU5NzE0NjE0MQ==&amp;mid=2247625445&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=247763288ee5ddbe442b8311f6199712&amp;chksm=fe5b4597c92ccc81ed0d6adc354aa87bd78cce800d787a6b190da1808641853662ed5daf83a5&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\">索尼</a>、<a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzU5NzE0NjE0MQ==&amp;mid=2247613851&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=20787adabaa667d80a09a12d0c10f51c&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\">JBL、佳明</a>、<a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzU5NzE0NjE0MQ==&amp;mid=2247717013&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=13037b2ba688adaa7cedf83f23947930&amp;chksm=fe5a3fe7c92db6f13ab52609b0524573862b1c3e1a4385775913fde1d4900b448efa42a261f2&amp;token=1674268063&amp;lang=zh_CN&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\">小米</a>、<a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/1jWr6vXGrPymf2lGQiybNA\">Logitech罗技</a>、<a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/NJd5s6WEXPALJJ1SWV1JSA\">Sennheiser森海塞尔</a>、<a href=\"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzU5NzE0NjE0MQ==&amp;mid=2247626804&amp;idx=2&amp;sn=b369c6979b68a8dc627b6c6da6cf14f1&amp;chksm=fe5b5f46c92cd6502affa23e8900bd287b346c766264183e7c724d667d76f60752ae2eea3801&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\">飞利浦</a>、<a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzU5NzE0NjE0MQ==&amp;mid=2247672609&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=fc822bb42700624628b4a1e43ff9a5e0&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\">Whoop</a>、<a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzU5NzE0NjE0MQ==&amp;mid=2247699128&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=9cf6d56fa1246fd6ca7d87ffa933d0a6&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\">LG</a>、<a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzU5NzE0NjE0MQ==&amp;mid=2247695724&amp;idx=3&amp;sn=ba2184251c9e34cc89735ab5a7fc881e&amp;chksm=fe5a521ec92ddb08dc16f618fa3294ca2e5380d738830d9cefde02f9eecec096a1e1f1bd28c8&amp;token=1326721765&amp;lang=zh_CN&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\">欧乐B</a>、<a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/J-utStaxDJceLxC2RKaHhg?token=1749749571&amp;lang=zh_CN\">Waterpik洁碧</a>、<a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/fbT3FFgS80AhyS1rLxqNkg?token=340930059&amp;lang=zh_CN\">雷鸟</a>等知名品牌的众多款产品采用豪鹏科技旗下的电池产品。</p><p><span><img src=\"https://52audio-images.oss-cn-shenzhen.aliyuncs.com/uploads/2026/11/09/dmqayp43vg3zxc1kka\"></span></p><p>电池另外一侧特写，打码用于产品追溯。</p><p><span><img src=\"https://52audio-images.oss-cn-shenzhen.aliyuncs.com/uploads/2026/11/09/dmqayppppzvwyk7nii\"></span></p><p>电容式佩戴检测传感器特写。</p><p><span><img src=\"https://52audio-images.oss-cn-shenzhen.aliyuncs.com/uploads/2026/11/09/dmqayqbe9myc7bfhe2\"></span></p><p>光学佩戴检测传感器特写，两种传感器结构，避免误触发。</p><p><span><img src=\"https://52audio-images.oss-cn-shenzhen.aliyuncs.com/uploads/2026/11/09/dmqayqwzppkidxblpn\"></span></p><p>镭雕G335的MEMS麦克风，用于语音通话、AI助手等功能拾音。</p><p><span><img src=\"https://52audio-images.oss-cn-shenzhen.aliyuncs.com/uploads/2026/11/09/dmqayrioyq1x06krn3\"></span></p><p>排线连接主板的BTB连接器公座特写。</p><p><span><img src=\"https://52audio-images.oss-cn-shenzhen.aliyuncs.com/uploads/2026/11/09/dmqays4gjzm4ndcqng\"></span></p><p>丝印NS H的IC。</p><p><span><img src=\"https://52audio-images.oss-cn-shenzhen.aliyuncs.com/uploads/2026/11/09/dmqaysprt6hjtsexd0\"></span></p><p>丝印“XH6B AAE6”的IC。</p><p><span><img src=\"https://52audio-images.oss-cn-shenzhen.aliyuncs.com/uploads/2026/11/09/dmqaytc444ixh0xtfw\"></span></p><p>沿合模打开听音球。</p><p><span><img src=\"https://52audio-images.oss-cn-shenzhen.aliyuncs.com/uploads/2026/11/09/dmqaytxzj4zvbtestx\"></span></p><p>前腔内部扬声器单元结构一览。</p><p><span><img src=\"https://52audio-images.oss-cn-shenzhen.aliyuncs.com/uploads/2026/11/09/dmqayujvobzamfl3fl\"></span></p><p>后腔内部结构一览，底部设置有麦克风。</p><p><span><img src=\"https://52audio-images.oss-cn-shenzhen.aliyuncs.com/uploads/2026/11/09/dmqayv5kukrasv9byf\"></span></p><p>取出后腔内部的麦克风。</p><p><span><img src=\"https://52audio-images.oss-cn-shenzhen.aliyuncs.com/uploads/2026/11/09/dmqayvrii1fn3cgbo6\"></span></p><p>取掉金属盖，腔体内部的骨传导麦克风结构一览。</p><p><span><img src=\"https://52audio-images.oss-cn-shenzhen.aliyuncs.com/uploads/2026/11/09/dmqaywdiaosdq0hxg7\"></span></p><p>取出骨传导麦克风结构。</p><p><span><img src=\"https://52audio-images.oss-cn-shenzhen.aliyuncs.com/uploads/2026/11/09/dmqaywjdfqeja6qhmq\"></span></p><p>镭雕二维码的VPU骨传导麦克风特写，用于捕捉用户说话时声带的骨传导震动，实现更精准的拾音。</p><p><span><img src=\"https://52audio-images.oss-cn-shenzhen.aliyuncs.com/uploads/2026/11/09/dmqayx5345vt1qjktp\"></span></p><p>掀开扬声器，前腔底部也设置有麦克风。</p><p><span><img src=\"https://52audio-images.oss-cn-shenzhen.aliyuncs.com/uploads/2026/11/09/dmqayxao64kv2bqd8h\"></span></p><p>取出前腔内部的所有元器件。</p><p><span><img src=\"https://52audio-images.oss-cn-shenzhen.aliyuncs.com/uploads/2026/11/09/dmqayxwm3om23opyfh\"></span></p><p>耳机扬声器正面特写，在拆解过程中变形。据官方介绍，采用了12磁铁双环聚磁单元，通过创新环侧贴合技术，实现0.8mm超大振幅，振动面积等效13mm扬声器，带来强劲的低音效果；采用碳纤维振膜，实现毫秒级响应，声音细节更丰富。</p><p><span><img src=\"https://52audio-images.oss-cn-shenzhen.aliyuncs.com/uploads/2026/11/09/dmqayyitiezie4yoty\"></span></p><p>扬声器背面特写。</p><p><span><img src=\"https://52audio-images.oss-cn-shenzhen.aliyuncs.com/uploads/2026/11/09/dmqayz4dqd056anxxd\"></span></p><p>扬声器与一元硬币大小对比。</p><p><span><img src=\"https://52audio-images.oss-cn-shenzhen.aliyuncs.com/uploads/2026/11/09/dmqayzbcfmfvyyqodo\"></span></p><p>镭雕G335的MEMS麦克风特写。</p><p><span><img src=\"https://52audio-images.oss-cn-shenzhen.aliyuncs.com/uploads/2026/11/09/dmqayzgyh6chmwftrl\"></span></p><p>镭雕G334的MEMS麦克风特写。</p><p><span><img src=\"https://52audio-images.oss-cn-shenzhen.aliyuncs.com/uploads/2026/11/09/dmqaz02g4urq5phh6x\"></span></p><p>Qwen千问AI耳夹式耳机拆解全家福。</p><h4>三、我爱音频网总结</h4><p><span><img src=\"https://52audio-images.oss-cn-shenzhen.aliyuncs.com/uploads/2026/11/09/dmqaz09bz44l8jpphx\"></span></p><p>最后附上Qwen千问AI耳夹式耳机的已知物料清单，方便大家查阅。</p><p>Qwen千问AI耳夹式耳机在外观方面，采用了目前主流的设计。圆角矩形充电盒，体积小巧便携，类金属磨砂工艺处理，质感出色；耳夹式耳机通体采用NCVM真空镀膜工艺，呈现高光镜面金属质感，搭配C桥与腔体一体化设计，机身线条流畅，观感简约时尚。</p><p>内部主要配置方面，充电盒搭载了AEC国光电子3.91V/530mAh锂电池组，采用了思远半导体SY6302超低功耗电量计芯片、SinhMicro昇生微电子SSP707电源管理芯片、SouthChip南芯SS26L113NRSA RISC-V低功耗微控制器，以及无线充电接收芯片、TVS管、霍尔元件等方案，支撑充电盒的各项功能。</p><p>耳机内部搭载豪鹏科技55mAh软包扣式电池，采用12磁铁双环聚磁单元，内置3个MEMS麦克风+1个骨传导麦克风，主控芯片采用了BES恒玄科技BES2810ZP蓝牙音频SoC，其他还采用了思远半导体SY6302电量计芯片、存储器、六轴陀螺仪等方案。</p>",
